WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Grow the board one stage at a time.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.400
Words keep their places as the board grows.

3
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.600
New words appear in spots saved for them,

4
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:13.800
so the words your child already knows
never move.

5
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:17.600
When your child is using the current words,

6
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:21.600
open the adult menu: hold the small circle
for 3 seconds,

7
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:25.000
then enter your passcode.

8
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.600
Look at Vocabulary stage to see progress.

9
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.400
V.O.I.C.E. suggests the next stage when enough of
the current words are in everyday use.

10
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:40.800
You decide.

11
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:45.400
An adult confirms every change.

12
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:51.000
New words then appear in their own saved spots.

13
00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:58.000
V.O.I.C.E. A free AAC app for children
who are new to AAC.
